# Enterprise fail-closed demonstration: a raw-socket network payload with a
# port bind. Relaxed mode compiles with warnings; --hard refuses the build so
# the artifact can never reach a production gate.
#   sentryc examples/network_attack.pi                  (warnings, exit 0)
#   sentryc --hard examples/network_attack.pi           (refused, exit 2)
#   sentryc audit --hard examples/network_attack.pi     (refused, exit 2)
LINK PIN 18 TO ALERT_LED AS OUTPUT
ALERT_LED HIGH
LOG "payload: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_RAW) 0.0.0.0; bind(0.0.0.0); sendto(...) port 4444"
DELAY 100 MS
ALERT_LED LOW